---
kind: lore
id: talks
---

// Wherever Sol is, once: one beat over the whole kind.
<beat id="solWarm" on="visit" target="kind:place" once="false" when="holds('at', ['sol', occasion.target])">
  @narrator: Sol makes room for you.
  ::set{run.warmth += 1}
</beat>

<entry id="empty" on="visit" target="kind:place" priority="-1">
  @narrator: Nobody.
</entry>
